    <MicrosoftCodeAnalysisVersion_LatestVS>5.11.0-1.26420.103</MicrosoftCodeAnalysisVersion_LatestVS>
    <!-- Newer analyzers and code fixes use the latest VS-compatible Roslyn packages rather than the older analyzer defaults. -->
    <Analyzer_MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpVersion_LatestVS>$(MicrosoftCodeAnalysisVersion_LatestVS)</Analyzer_MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpVersion_LatestVS>
